bate Today  George Custer provides a much more mixed  reaction than he did 100 years ago some  have called him a butcher a callous  murderer accused of killing and raping  women and children using them as human  Shields others claim he was no better or  worse than any other white men of the  period that he didn't hate Indians he  just did what his government ordered him  to do as an army officer a few people  still consider him to be a hero work and  as the years pass and he disappears into  the pages of history that seems unlikely  too many people never will again  [Music]
 

